    "updated_at": "2023-04-05T08:40:18Z",
    "body": "Perhaps we should handle this in the WebIDL binding? That is, change the [asynchronous iterator prototype object](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#es-asynchronous-iterator-prototype-object) so the *rejectSteps* in step 8.7 call the [asynchronous iterator return](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#asynchronous-iterator-return) algorithm.\r\n\r\nOtherwise, other specs that define an async iterable (such as the [File System API](https://fs.spec.whatwg.org/#api-filesystemdirectoryhandle-asynciterable)) may run into the same issue.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
